{"title":"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/e/13e8beb1955813eaaf1b3642225792abcc02c9e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sin{10^\\circ}+\\sin{20^\\circ}}{\\cos{10^\\circ}+\\cos{20^\\circ}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"131\" height=\"39\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/3/e235ac1b0e1c4f2d057979741580d6d98d02fac3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ }\\tan{10^\\circ}+\\tan{20^\\circ} \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }\\tan{30^\\circ} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } \\frac{1}{2}(\\tan{10^\\circ}+\\tan{20^\\circ}) \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }\\tan{15^\\circ} \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } \\frac{1}{4}\\tan{60^\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"778\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Trigonometric_identities#Prosthaphaeresis_Identities\" title=\"Trigonometric identities\">sum-to-product formulas</a>, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/d/d8d68847e38606d42ce41e8cb817b5ceb91ffd0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin{a}+\\sin{b}=2\\sin{\\frac{a+b}{2}}\\cos{\\frac{a-b}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"268\" height=\"37\" />. So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/6/2f6a4cd1aba76d08064401b88ee2d8efe951c461.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin{10^\\circ}+\\sin{20^\\circ}=2\\sin{15^\\circ}\\cos{5^\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"257\" height=\"14\" />. Also from the sum-to-product formulas, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/5/305fec7bf1d10b1469b31c259b48e6dffc72e8fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos{a}+\\cos{b}=2\\cos{\\frac{a+b}{2}}\\cos{\\frac{a-b}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"274\" height=\"37\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/a/21ad7caf62676d562d46ed944f7316e72cd9aeed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos{10^\\circ}+\\cos{20^\\circ}=2\\cos{15^\\circ}\\cos{5^\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"263\" height=\"14\" />. Substituting these back into the original fraction, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/1/1c11f7cff00ab08af23f2a60022f994947315c95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sin{10^\\circ}+\\sin{20^\\circ}}{\\cos{10^\\circ}+\\cos{20^\\circ}}=\\frac{2\\sin{15^\\circ}\\cos{5^\\circ}}{2\\cos{15^\\circ}\\cos{5^\\circ}}=\\frac{\\sin{15^\\circ}}{\\cos{15^\\circ}}=\\tan{15^\\circ}, \\boxed{\\text{D}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"466\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME\" title=\"1984 AHSME\">1984 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1984 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1984\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/